<title>USA: Westinghouse Air buys co from Mark IV.</title>
<headline>Westinghouse Air buys co from Mark IV.</headline>
<dateline>WILMERDING, Pa. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westinghouse Air Brake Co said Thursday it has acquired Vapor Corp from Mark IV Industries Inc for about $65 million.</p>
<p>The purchase price includes $63 million in cash and $2 million in potential, future sales-related performance payments, the company said.</p>
<p>Westinghouse Air Brake said a large portion of the projected increase in revenue is expected to be derived from new contracts for Vapor to provide door systems for the London Underground, a project that has already begun.</p>
</text>
